WEBVTT

00:03.611 --> 00:07.274
I want that gun so that I can
help my friends fight the enemy...

00:07.348 --> 00:09.578
...and rescue the special person
they care so much about.

00:11.386 --> 00:14.878
I don't want to be the one
that holds them up!

00:15.990 --> 00:18.891
What if I was to say no?

00:20.828 --> 00:22.921
I won't give up trying
until you agree.

00:24.299 --> 00:25.960
This isn't it, either...

00:35.610 --> 00:36.736
These are...!

00:40.548 --> 00:41.776
Go!

00:46.154 --> 00:47.314
Yes!

00:47.388 --> 00:48.150
You did it!

01:02.370 --> 01:07.501
So the Company is somewhere
at the end of this line, huh?

01:08.409 --> 01:10.434
Well, that's the assumption.

01:11.779 --> 01:14.543
But it's still too early to celebrate.

01:14.615 --> 01:15.547
I know.

01:16.084 --> 01:18.951
We're going to have to fight off
some master warriors, aren't we?

01:19.053 --> 01:22.022
I wouldn't speak of the
master warriors so casually.

01:22.090 --> 01:22.579
Huh?

01:23.057 --> 01:26.288
Those warriors are tough fighters
who not only have special powers...

01:26.361 --> 01:29.387
...but have also undergone
extensive combat training.

01:29.797 --> 01:31.822
And there's something
you're not understanding.

01:32.400 --> 01:33.458
Not understanding?

01:33.634 --> 01:35.829
Seki and Teil and even Shiel...

01:35.903 --> 01:37.768
...were holding back
when they fought you.

01:38.940 --> 01:40.931
Wh-What do you mean?

01:41.776 --> 01:43.141
Think about it for a moment.

01:43.511 --> 01:48.175
What would happen if power users
fought for real on the surface?

01:48.249 --> 01:50.444
Of course we'd hold back.

01:54.455 --> 01:57.947
And they also didn't consider
you to be a power user.

01:58.459 --> 01:58.925
Huh?

01:59.694 --> 02:03.790
B-But I've been fighting
with everything I've got!

02:03.865 --> 02:04.923
That's not my problem.

02:04.999 --> 02:05.624
Wha...?!

02:06.034 --> 02:08.025
H-Hey! Don't walk away!

02:09.337 --> 02:11.362
Wait for me, you guys!

02:13.875 --> 02:17.936
And there are tougher guys
down here than the master warriors.

02:18.146 --> 02:21.013
W-Wait for me! Hey!

02:40.501 --> 02:44.062
Yoru no machi wa tsumetai ne

02:44.138 --> 02:47.938
kokoro umore naku nari sou

02:48.009 --> 02:51.308
mae ni susumeru ka douka daro

02:51.379 --> 02:53.870
taisetsu na koto wa

02:53.948 --> 02:56.109
oshiete yo

02:56.184 --> 02:57.913
ne

02:58.152 --> 03:03.112
hito wa hanareru tameni deau no?

03:03.191 --> 03:08.527
Machigai dato omowa sete

03:08.596 --> 03:12.327
akireru hodoni aishiteta

03:12.400 --> 03:15.927
nani mo kamo ga kira meite

03:16.003 --> 03:19.336
osoreru koto nante nani

03:19.407 --> 03:23.173
hitotsu naito shinji teta

03:23.244 --> 03:26.736
jyonetsu ga oto wo tatete

03:26.814 --> 03:30.341
kuzure ochiru shun kan wo

03:30.418 --> 03:33.819
wasure wa shinai itsu made mo

03:33.888 --> 03:37.415
modori tai nante iwa nai yo

03:37.492 --> 03:43.226
tada kimi ni mou ichido dake aitai

03:56.477 --> 03:57.278
The Revenge of the Water User

03:57.278 --> 04:00.548
The Revenge of the Water User
The Revenge of the Water User.

04:00.548 --> 04:03.949
The Revenge of the Water User

04:18.733 --> 04:21.361
Mr. Suijen.
I need your signature.

04:22.537 --> 04:25.438
The repairs to the West 5th District
are complete.

04:25.873 --> 04:28.341
We'll power up the area
first thing tomorrow.

04:28.676 --> 04:32.339
Also, I have a situation report
on the resistance forces...

04:32.413 --> 04:34.176
...at the No. 8 Power Station.

04:37.151 --> 04:39.745
In regard to that matter...

04:39.820 --> 04:43.085
...I myself will go there
and deal with it.

04:46.627 --> 04:49.687
How are the master warriors'
shifts set up?

04:49.764 --> 04:53.757
The regular forces are standing by
in their assigned places.

04:53.901 --> 04:56.199
Would you consider using
reserve forces?

04:56.270 --> 04:58.636
There's no need to call on them
as of yet.

05:11.586 --> 05:13.781
Hello, Mr. Suijen.

05:16.557 --> 05:21.494
What do you, a man so obsessed
with the mysterious Dragons...

05:21.562 --> 05:23.393
...want with me?

05:24.232 --> 05:25.699
Obsessed?

05:26.100 --> 05:27.089
Me?

05:28.369 --> 05:29.336
I don't think so.

05:29.937 --> 05:33.031
Lord Kashin ordered
the search for the Dragons.

05:33.541 --> 05:37.375
Our surveys show that we have
pinpointed its location.

05:38.613 --> 05:41.639
Once we have confirmation
of the Dragons' existence...

05:42.850 --> 05:45.318
...we will go into the Underglobe.

05:47.154 --> 05:49.782
I hope this doesn't end in disappointment.

06:01.435 --> 06:02.766
Damn!

06:02.937 --> 06:05.838
No matter how far we walk
and walk and walk...

06:05.906 --> 06:08.204
...it's the same old scenery!

06:08.309 --> 06:09.970
I'm getting tired of this!

06:10.278 --> 06:12.269
If you have enough energy to yell...

06:12.346 --> 06:14.439
...you should be able to
keep walking!

06:15.016 --> 06:16.984
You sure are a whiner!

06:17.051 --> 06:18.143
What did you say?!

06:18.986 --> 06:23.218
I mean, are we actually going to
get to the Company this way?!

06:23.291 --> 06:25.623
There's no way of knowing
unless we go, right?!

06:27.628 --> 06:28.458
L-Look, you!

06:29.697 --> 06:31.289
Why are you so stubborn?!

06:31.365 --> 06:33.663
What about you?

06:33.734 --> 06:34.496
Huh?

06:44.211 --> 06:47.874
Besides, you're always
screwing up, time after time!

06:47.948 --> 06:50.007
And you're always whining!

06:50.084 --> 06:53.281
R-Rumina! C-Chelsea!
Come here, quick!

06:53.487 --> 06:55.216
What's the matter, Ginnosuke?

06:56.924 --> 06:57.583
Wha...?!

06:58.059 --> 06:59.458
What is this?!

07:08.269 --> 07:12.103
There's a whole other world
underneath the Underground.

07:12.707 --> 07:15.175
Wh-What is this place?

07:16.143 --> 07:17.610
It's the Underglobe.

07:18.279 --> 07:19.439
Underglobe?

07:22.383 --> 07:24.681
When the Dragons once
ran amuck...

07:24.752 --> 07:26.379
...it is said that they created a cave.

07:26.787 --> 07:30.154
Another world that lies
below the Underground...

07:31.492 --> 07:32.584
The Dragons...

07:32.860 --> 07:33.758
Wow...

07:36.430 --> 07:38.660
Maybe now you understand
the power of the Dragons...

07:38.733 --> 07:41.133
...and why the Company wants them.

07:41.202 --> 07:44.694
Of course there are many people
who are against...

07:44.772 --> 07:46.706
...the Company's dictatorial ways.

07:46.841 --> 07:50.641
The job of the master warriors
is to oppress those people.

07:54.281 --> 07:57.307
For the purpose of keeping
the peace in the Underground.

07:57.385 --> 07:58.818
Very clever.

08:03.991 --> 08:05.185
This attack is...!

08:08.162 --> 08:09.789
I think you've got the idea.

08:10.398 --> 08:14.027
We've been pouring our
heart and soul into maintaining...

08:14.101 --> 08:17.662
...peace and order
in the Underground.

08:18.439 --> 08:20.907
Right, Chelsea Rorec?

08:21.342 --> 08:22.934
Shalma Rufis...

08:24.178 --> 08:25.668
Huh? You know her?

08:25.846 --> 08:27.370
We go way back.

08:27.748 --> 08:30.615
This is a girl that I've been
dying to see for some time now.

08:35.189 --> 08:39.819
I never thought we'd meet
so soon.

08:40.027 --> 08:40.755
What?!

08:43.397 --> 08:46.889
Welcome to the Underground.

08:47.067 --> 08:48.466
Wh-Why, you!

08:49.770 --> 08:53.729
Let's settle what we couldn't
last time we fought on the surface!

08:56.677 --> 08:57.871
Rumina!

09:03.417 --> 09:05.317
I am your opponent, Rorec!

09:05.853 --> 09:07.013
Don't forget that!

09:31.912 --> 09:33.345
I'm going to have some...

09:47.328 --> 09:48.795
Good morning.

09:48.863 --> 09:49.727
Good mor...

09:49.797 --> 09:51.162
No!

09:52.833 --> 09:55.131
How can I keep this up?

09:59.106 --> 10:00.095
Huh?

10:00.508 --> 10:01.566
Shiel?

10:02.209 --> 10:04.609
I have news for you, my Maiden.

10:12.520 --> 10:14.317
What's with that bandage?

10:15.923 --> 10:18.619
You must've had some
tough battles.

10:18.759 --> 10:20.488
Life must be hard for you.

10:20.794 --> 10:25.026
You should've stayed with the Company
and kept taking care of the Maiden.

10:25.332 --> 10:26.959
But instead...

10:27.034 --> 10:29.525
...you kidnapped the Maiden
because you wanted to...

10:29.603 --> 10:32.766
...live in the sunlight
on the surface?

10:34.842 --> 10:37.902
Have you forgotten what
the surface people...

10:37.978 --> 10:39.502
...have done to us?!

10:44.585 --> 10:47.782
I'll never forget what the
surface people have done to us.

10:48.122 --> 10:50.488
But I joined the Company...

10:50.558 --> 10:53.220
...to make the Underground
a better place.

10:53.727 --> 10:56.321
Not to take revenge
on the surface!

10:56.397 --> 10:58.098
- I've had enough of your nonsense!

10:58.098 --> 10:58.757
- I've had enough of your nonsense!
- Don't you understand?

11:00.000 --> 11:01.058
That's right.

11:01.602 --> 11:06.062
You were always the one who
couldn't process two thoughts at a time.

11:08.375 --> 11:09.672
How reassuring.

11:10.344 --> 11:12.835
That smart mouth of yours
hasn't changed a bit.

11:13.547 --> 11:15.947
Well, enough chitchat.

11:16.483 --> 11:17.609
Here goes!

11:17.685 --> 11:18.777
Hold it!

11:25.893 --> 11:27.360
What's this?

11:27.528 --> 11:29.689
I mean, who are you?

11:34.635 --> 11:36.364
Your little toy...

11:36.604 --> 11:37.434
Don't move!

11:38.572 --> 11:40.733
This is not a toy!

11:41.241 --> 11:45.905
This Spirit Gun fires rounds
infused with elemental powers.

11:46.714 --> 11:47.646
Spirit Gun?

11:48.148 --> 11:52.642
A non-power user like myself
can use powers with this gun!

11:52.720 --> 11:53.846
It's perfect.

11:54.188 --> 11:55.052
Oh?

11:55.456 --> 11:56.753
I understand now.

11:57.091 --> 11:58.718
Then, I want you to...

11:58.926 --> 11:59.893
But, you know...

12:01.762 --> 12:03.229
A toy is still a toy!

12:11.171 --> 12:12.798
A toy is still a toy!

12:16.210 --> 12:18.235
Fire it if you can!

12:31.992 --> 12:33.118
A note?

12:36.463 --> 12:37.828
It's from Master Sui.

12:40.134 --> 12:43.103
This gun is too powerful.

12:43.170 --> 12:47.038
In order for you to master it,
it will need a few modifications.

12:47.474 --> 12:51.103
As such, I will be keeping it with me
for some time.

12:52.479 --> 12:53.741
Sui.

12:55.549 --> 12:57.881
M-Master...

12:58.652 --> 13:00.483
I can't believe it.

13:00.788 --> 13:02.722
Now, step back.

13:02.790 --> 13:03.552
Okay...

13:04.958 --> 13:05.686
What?!

13:08.028 --> 13:08.790
R-Really?

13:09.329 --> 13:11.229
Yeah, it's true.

13:12.199 --> 13:15.657
The gravity user girl is apparently
back in the Underground.

13:15.803 --> 13:17.270
So, she's back...

13:18.038 --> 13:19.266
Chelsea's back?

13:19.573 --> 13:20.198
Yeah.

13:20.307 --> 13:23.538
And the wind user guy, too.

13:24.011 --> 13:24.739
What?

13:25.846 --> 13:27.507
Rumina's with her, too?!

13:27.581 --> 13:28.946
R-Really?!

13:29.483 --> 13:30.472
I-It's true...

13:34.955 --> 13:37.355
Boy! I thought I was going to die!

13:39.460 --> 13:40.358
Ruri?

13:42.296 --> 13:43.695
Hey, what's the matter?

13:43.997 --> 13:44.622
Hey?

13:46.667 --> 13:48.032
He came for me.

13:49.269 --> 13:50.201
Rumina...

13:52.673 --> 13:53.765
I'm so happy...

14:00.981 --> 14:02.039
Well?

14:02.616 --> 14:05.084
What do you think
of the Underground?

14:05.652 --> 14:08.780
The people here put their
resources together...

14:08.856 --> 14:10.949
...and help each other make a living.

14:11.358 --> 14:15.795
It's much better here compared
to the surface world which is...

14:15.863 --> 14:18.195
...full of anger,
betrayal, and hatred.

14:18.432 --> 14:19.694
I don't care about that!

14:21.268 --> 14:23.259
I want to know about Ruri!

14:23.570 --> 14:25.561
I understand how you feel.

14:25.639 --> 14:29.006
People get upset when those
important to them get taken away.

14:29.376 --> 14:32.174
However, you're being selfish.

14:35.616 --> 14:40.019
She has merely returned to the place
where she ought to be.

14:44.291 --> 14:46.759
The place where she ought to be?

14:47.861 --> 14:50.295
Who decided that?

14:50.964 --> 14:56.903
And why was Ruri crying
when she was taken away?!

15:00.073 --> 15:01.438
Nice wind.

15:01.842 --> 15:05.778
But I will not forget...

15:05.846 --> 15:07.507
...the scratch you put on me!

15:09.950 --> 15:11.542
That's impressive.

15:12.085 --> 15:14.883
You've improved since
the last time we fought...

15:14.955 --> 15:16.616
...when you just hacked away!

15:16.690 --> 15:17.588
Shut up!

15:18.559 --> 15:21.027
I've been training
so I can kill you!

15:23.197 --> 15:24.664
I'm honored.

15:25.032 --> 15:28.263
But I have the exact
same plans for you!

15:30.437 --> 15:31.802
Water Thread!

15:34.208 --> 15:34.970
Wh-What?!

15:36.476 --> 15:40.606
This sword was forged from
water under high pressure.

15:40.814 --> 15:44.181
And I can change its shape
according to my will!

15:57.331 --> 16:00.732
Rorec, I can see
right through you.

16:01.501 --> 16:04.026
You're using only one attack
because of your injury.

16:04.471 --> 16:08.032
Exerted only from top to bottom,
your gravity sure has its weaknesses.

16:08.876 --> 16:11.037
I'll strike you down the moment
you leap up!

16:13.180 --> 16:15.341
And then I'll finish you off slowly.

16:16.583 --> 16:17.572
Wh-What?!

16:22.623 --> 16:24.215
I'm sorry.

16:24.291 --> 16:26.156
But I'm feeling a little drained.

16:26.393 --> 16:29.453
How about we try it without
our powers?

16:30.264 --> 16:31.231
Sounds interesting.

16:32.733 --> 16:34.257
On second thought...

16:34.534 --> 16:37.025
I'll finish you off quick
with the power I gained...

16:37.104 --> 16:39.902
...while you were hanging out
with the Maiden!

16:43.210 --> 16:44.370
Nails of Ice.

16:45.145 --> 16:48.637
Nails brought to an ultra-low
temperature can cut anything.

16:49.650 --> 16:52.813
A technique that only a few
of us ice users are capable of.

16:53.153 --> 16:56.589
So you're not the same as when
you first joined the Company?

16:56.657 --> 16:57.919
Of course not!

17:11.271 --> 17:12.499
That's strange.

17:12.572 --> 17:15.769
I thought I avoided it,
but Shalma's arm lengthened!

17:18.111 --> 17:21.877
Don't think you can
get away with that!

17:25.719 --> 17:27.448
What are you aiming for?

17:28.622 --> 17:29.520
No way...

17:33.660 --> 17:34.627
Why?

17:35.062 --> 17:37.223
I can't get in close to her!

17:40.267 --> 17:41.097
Sorry...

17:42.169 --> 17:43.693
You're that happy about it?

17:44.604 --> 17:47.869
Maybe it's a little too early
to get your hopes up.

17:47.941 --> 17:48.430
What?

17:48.675 --> 17:51.803
From what I heard,
Teil and some ice user...

17:51.878 --> 17:53.505
...have gone to greet them.

17:54.047 --> 17:56.174
So by now, they could be...

17:59.820 --> 18:02.880
Chelsea's strong
so I'm not too worried...

18:02.956 --> 18:04.787
...but I'm worried about Rumina.

18:14.634 --> 18:15.464
Where is he?!

18:18.705 --> 18:19.467
Behind you!

18:23.243 --> 18:24.471
Th-This guy...

18:25.779 --> 18:29.476
I can't see his attack!

18:34.688 --> 18:35.347
Rumina!

18:39.826 --> 18:42.124
H-He's too strong...

18:44.531 --> 18:46.021
In all of nature...

18:46.099 --> 18:49.227
...there is no element that is
as versatile as water.

18:50.103 --> 18:54.665
And there is no one that can freely
manipulate water as well as I can.

18:54.775 --> 18:58.677
That gives me a definitive edge
over a one-trick fighter like you.

18:59.079 --> 19:01.843
I-I've had enough of your talk!

19:03.417 --> 19:05.885
You've put nothing but
a scratch on me.

19:06.219 --> 19:08.881
I can see right through
your water tricks!

19:11.458 --> 19:14.916
If I can't beat this guy,
it's all over.

19:15.395 --> 19:18.159
But a fight's not over
until it's over.

19:18.231 --> 19:21.257
Teil's pretty strong, but that
wind user guy's not bad either.

19:22.135 --> 19:23.295
He promised me.

19:23.804 --> 19:24.463
Promised?

19:25.105 --> 19:25.833
Promised what?

19:27.040 --> 19:29.873
That as long as he lives,
we'll meet again.

19:39.786 --> 19:40.582
Focus!

19:42.722 --> 19:44.519
Asagi Swordsmanship!

19:44.925 --> 19:46.324
Gale Force Wind!

19:48.962 --> 19:49.860
Block!

19:56.269 --> 19:57.634
Gale Force Wind.

19:57.704 --> 19:59.137
I know it well.

19:59.473 --> 20:01.805
It's the same trick you used...

20:01.875 --> 20:04.571
...to deflect the magnetic power
of Rou.

20:04.778 --> 20:07.406
But even such a powerful
sword of wind...

20:07.481 --> 20:10.382
...is no match for a 100-ton
wall of water.

20:11.718 --> 20:12.742
We'll see!

20:14.221 --> 20:16.815
Gale Force Wind!

20:20.794 --> 20:21.886
Another one!

20:21.962 --> 20:22.690
Block!

20:27.000 --> 20:28.160
Wh-What?!

20:44.184 --> 20:48.985
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:49.055 --> 20:54.960
migakareru machi nami wo

20:55.028 --> 21:07.407
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:08.208 --> 21:19.107
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:19.186 --> 21:30.154
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.498 --> 21:40.270
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:40.340 --> 21:44.071
kikou to shita

21:44.144 --> 21:52.313
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:52.385 --> 22:01.350
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:10.237 --> 22:12.205
Preview

22:12.739 --> 22:16.300
I can now see clearly
how he moves.

22:16.943 --> 22:19.002
Hell, it's easy.

22:19.613 --> 22:22.605
You just have to let
your body feel the wind.

22:22.849 --> 22:23.679
That's all.

22:24.117 --> 22:27.177
And the wind is subject
to my will!

22:27.454 --> 22:28.182
Rat-Tail!

22:28.555 --> 22:30.614
You have no chance of beating me!

22:30.690 --> 22:33.682
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:33.760 --> 22:35.595
..."Fight to the Death -
Beyond the Hatred".

22:35.595 --> 22:35.996
Fight to the Death -
Beyond the Hatred
..."Fight to the Death -
Beyond the Hatred".

22:35.996 --> 22:40.092
Fight to the Death -
Beyond the Hatred
